      "supersededBy": "0.0.10426591",
      "why": "Superseded by the delete-one half of the acceptance test in app/OPERATIONS.md §4: this row was removed from the record and the run created a new instance of that entity type and nothing else, which is what the test asserts. This topic exists on the ledger, carries the agent as its sole submit key and its admin key, and is not the deployment’s manifest topic. It is recorded here so that entities holds exactly one manifest and no reader is left wondering what an orphan topic is. Deletable under its admin key; left in place as the evidence the test ran."
